  "description": "Meet the Kommoda 3.0, Cyrusher’s most versatile step-through e-bike yet. Designed with upgraded 20x4.0” Arisun fat tires and a more robust frame, it’s ready for riders of all sizes and skill levels.\nWhether you’re commuting to work, cruising with family, or carrying cargo, the Kommoda 3.0 combines comfort, stability, and confidence in every ride. A powerful rear hub motor paired with a responsive torque sensor ensures smooth, natural power exactly when you need it—flattening hills, extending range, and making every journey effortless.\nComfort upgrades like enhanced suspension, ergonomic design, and wide step-through access make mounting and dismounting simple, while the fat tires keep you steady on both pavement and paths.\nThe Kommoda 3.0 delivers the freedom to ride your way—every day.\nKey Highlights:\n\nStep-through design for easy on/off\n\n20x4.0” Arisun fat tires for grip & stability\n\nRobust frame supports a wide range of riders\n\nTorque sensor for smooth, intuitive pedaling\n\nPerfect for commuting, leisure cruising, or light cargo",
